    "long_desc": "This is the recommended general-purpose app for workflows that do not have a dedicated DesignSafe app: post-processing pipelines, parameter sweeps, mpi4py codes, machine-learning jobs, OpenSeesPy, and user-compiled solvers. Instead of registering a new app for each analysis type, you bring an input directory and a script; everything else is optional configuration.",
